                        ],
                        "form": "Instagrammed"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "5aceea67-0bbc-477e-83d4-13511b4ac498",
                        "entry_id": "96a2b8c8-a15b-344e-aed8-c3d1a67c4e85",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "Instagrammed"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5992a854-b14e-3be1-a325-8be71c00ab66",
                        "entry_id": "96a2b8c8-a15b-344e-aed8-c3d1a67c4e85",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To use the social networking service Instagram."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8329122-531b-4869-abe0-5b631d6129c8",
                                "sense_id": "5992a854-b14e-3be1-a325-8be71c00ab66",
                                "text": "The thinking goes that if the modern audience watches TV on laptops, while Instagramming and checking emails at the same time, why would contemporary artists ignore that and insist on trapping them in a silent black box for an hour?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "27425841-4d47-309b-b16d-12eddbbfc516",
                        "entry_id": "96a2b8c8-a15b-344e-aed8-c3d1a67c4e85",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To post an image or video to Instagram."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "ambitransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e4340239-61ef-4725-b512-ae2033d6c6a8",
                                "sense_id": "27425841-4d47-309b-b16d-12eddbbfc516",
                                "text": "Her mother cried when she answered / Said she don't know what got inside this child's mind, she planted / A box of condoms on her dresser then she Instagrammed it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c04ad880-6567-4218-a4af-012d189944d9",
                                "sense_id": "27425841-4d47-309b-b16d-12eddbbfc516",
                                "text": "[see title]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bb720db0-a894-3afa-aefe-777bf4fa5e34",
                        "entry_id": "96a2b8c8-a15b-344e-aed8-c3d1a67c4e85",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To digitally manipulate a photograph using filter effects."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "ambitransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e085f6dc-c3e7-4e19-bca0-16361ba68a9d",
                                "sense_id": "bb720db0-a894-3afa-aefe-777bf4fa5e34",
                                "text": "To illustrate, I used B-roll of photos on the iPhone that were being “Instagrammed” (Figure 8.6) with fun filters along with screen captures of Instragram's No. 1 ranking in the iTunes App Store and the Apple website touting the iPhone 4S."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4de3fb68-ad0c-4f25-a975-f5a503fac424",
                                "sense_id": "bb720db0-a894-3afa-aefe-777bf4fa5e34",
                                "text": "In a world where it is de rigueur to announce your wedding on Facebook and show the world artfully Instagrammed pictures of your appendectomy, it's no surprise that the Bee has a social media presence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "546cc48f-b7fe-418f-a1b5-8c1135ec2fe4",
                                "sense_id": "bb720db0-a894-3afa-aefe-777bf4fa5e34",
                                "text": "There he was, staring cheekily into the camera for a perfectly instagrammed photo which had been touched up to show off his muscles, raw sex appeal and wild, unkempt hair."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d5fc240-8417-4914-8893-7ef3605acce8",
                                "sense_id": "bb720db0-a894-3afa-aefe-777bf4fa5e34",
                                "text": "The cameras were out and we were all trying to get pictures of each other, which we then spent a further half an hour trying to Instagram to make us look as good as possible"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
